    <title>In our Winter 2025–26 issue, Playboy goes on the record with Kid Cudi — the artist who rewired hip-hop with raw emotion.moves with quiet confidence in a Culver City studio, his shadow stretching across the wall in a salmon Saint Laurent shirt and long LGN coat.From &quot;Day n&apos; Nite&quot; to Entergalactic, Cudi has spent over a decade reshaping culture and expanding the emotional depth of hip-hop. Now 41, Cudi is grounded but still reaching higher, freshly married, at peace and standing in a season of balance.Jayson Buford sat down with Cudi to discuss marriage, movies and what&apos;s next. Get the Winter 2025–26 issue — available for purchase on newsstands or online at https://t.co/5U6SpyDo00 — to read the full interview.Editorial Director: Cassie AndersonPhotographer: Mason PooleDirector of Photography: Dax BlinnCreative Director: Smiley StevensDesign &amp; Visuals Director: Mallory RoynonStylist: Jason RembertGroomer: Brielle McKennaBarber: The Barber SyProps: Gil &amp; Roy Props</title>
